@page "/about"

<h1>About OP or Death ☠</h1>

<div class="panel" style="max-width:760px">
    <p>
        <strong>OP or Death</strong> is a One Piece TCG companion: deck builder, collection
        tracker, pack simulator, meta dashboard, and store/event finder. Built for players who
        live and breathe the game (and a little death metal).
    </p>
    <p>
        Made with 🏴‍☠️ &amp; 🤘 by <strong>Pseudocorpse</strong>. Its a labor of love and a
        work in progress. New features are always being forged.
    </p>

    <h2>Thank you</h2>
    <p class="muted">
        To everyone testing, breaking, and suggesting features. You're the crew that makes this
        worth building. Card data &amp; art © Eiichiro Oda / Shueisha / Toei / Bandai. This is a
        fan project and not affiliated with Bandai.
    </p>

    <h2>Support the project</h2>
    <p class="muted">
        Servers, card data, and coffee cost money. If OP or Death helps your game, tossing a few
        Berries in the hat keeps it sailing. 🙏
    </p>
    <div class="link-row">
        <a class="btn-link" href="@KoFi" target="_blank">☕ Ko-fi</a>
        <a class="btn-link secondary-link" href="@PayPal" target="_blank">💳 PayPal</a>
        <a class="btn-link secondary-link" href="@BuyMeACoffee" target="_blank">🍔 Buy Me a Burger</a>
        <a class="btn-link secondary-link" href="@Venmo" target="_blank">💸 Venmo</a>
        <a class="btn-link secondary-link" href="@CashApp" target="_blank">💵 Cash App</a>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:.8rem; margin-top:1rem">
        Note to Pseudocorpse: replace the links above with your real donation URLs (edit
        <code>Components/Pages/About.razor</code>). Right now they point to the sign-up pages.
    </p>
</div>

